  "notes": "Westwing Collection Wolke, the modular bouclé sofa as a 3-seater, 256 cm. Sizes from Westwing's product pages (westwing.ch, \"Modulares Sofa Wolke (3-Sitzer) aus Bouclé\", light beige, DEQ24WES49002-205519; the same sofa in light blue on westwing.ee, 24WES40649): 256 wide, 118 deep, 65 high; the seat 180 wide, 84 deep and 41 high; the armrests 43 wide and 50 high; plastic feet 2 cm high, hidden underneath. Westwing calls it a 3-seater, though it is two modules, each a seat with its back and one armrest, joined in the middle; this item is the whole sofa. model.glb is generated by `npx tsx tools/models/sofa-westwing-wolke-256.ts` from its own geometry after Westwing's photos: two broad, soft seat blocks reaching almost to the floor, with a narrow groove between them; two thick, rounded backs leaning gently back above the seats; and a low, pillowed armrest at each end. The armrests are as deep as the seats, so behind them the backs alone reach the rear: plan for the full 256 × 118 cm, though the rear 34 cm are only 192 wide. Westwing makes Wolke in bouclé (light beige: 96 % polyester, 4 % acrylic; light blue: 100 % polyester) and other fabrics. The fabrics here are planning colours, not Westwing's swatches: the default cream bouclé is close to its light beige, and fabric.boucle-light-blue to its light blue. The seat is a surface, so cushions and throws can go on it."
